    "Ascension each Heroic kill also left one random Heroic dungeon item (db.exil.es archive: about 889-1013 items at",
    "about 0.11 % each). Each corpse now rolls the Dungeon Spoils (Heroic) item pool (reference 1202039) once, so",
    "nearly every fill holds a rare or better item, and each Heroic kill leaves one Heroic gear item of item level 61."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
